# The Master page's scope: while a song plays, the master output's wave moves behind the EQ curve (smooth); with nothing
# sounding, or under MOTION still, that part of the screen holds. tests/scope_check.py reads the frames this writes.
wait 300
expect still 0
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 700
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
expect page Master_EQ
wait 500
wait 16
shot playing_00.png
wait 16
shot playing_01.png
wait 16
